    "status": "present",
    "value": "Return the transpose of the square matrix (a new matrix; input unchanged). Concurrency is modelled deterministically: rows of the output are partitioned into min(numThreads, n) contiguous blocks and each simulated worker fills its block; the result is independent of the partition, so only the transpose is observable."
  },
